ties was ₹26.74 Cr in H1 FY27 versus ₹7.05 Cr in H1 FY26.\n- Advance tax was paid on every working day of FY26, reflecting stated fiscal discipline.","src":"deck","title":"Capital allocation policy (investor deck)"}],"business":[{"body":"- Full-stack financial services company headquartered in Indore with 31 years of uninterrupted operations, listed on both NSE and BSE, serving HNI, UHNI and corporate clients across broking, F&O, commodities, currency derivatives, depository, wealth management and algorithmic trading.\n- Holds 10 licences and memberships spanning SEBI, NSE, BSE, CDSL, NCDEX, MCX, AMFI, MSEI and NSE IX (GIFT City), with a network of 28 branches and authorised persons across 12 cities in 4 states.\n- Board combines 180+ years of experience, with senior leadership (Chairman, Managing Director) each holding 38-44+ years in capital and derivative markets; about 30% of the senior team has 20-25 years' tenure.","src":"deck","title":"Positioning (investor deck)"},{"body":"- [Demerger structure] Indo Thai Financial Services Limited (ITFSL) would hold the broking, distribution, depository (99.6% of turnover), treasury desk, capital-raising advisory/research and the GIFT City subsidiary, and be listed as a pure-play financial services comparable to listed peers; Indo Thai Securities Limited (ITSL) would continue as a vehicle holding Femto Tech Energy Systems Limited (fuel efficiency technology, formerly Femto Green Hydrogen) and Indo Thai Realties Limited (real estate and co-working).\n- [Capital markets proof point] Assisted pre-IPO client TNA Solutions, which has since listed on the BSE SME platform, cited as validating the company's capital-raising and advisory business and adding a fee stream beyond broking and distribution.\n- [Recognition] Received the Kotak Mutual Fund Excellence Award 2026 for the highest fresh SIP number and largest SIP book; was Associated Partner at the CII Leadership Conclave in Indore; CEO is Sector Chair for Financial Services an